      "created_at": "2013-04-20T15:33:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ok, question about Plague Rat’s various cards that tell you search the villain deck for other cards. I.e. Noxious Bite;</p>\n<p>“Search the villain Deck for a copy of the card Infection. Put it into play. Shuffle the villain deck.”</p>\n<p>At a point in the game this came out, all instances of Infection we’re either in play already or in the villain trash. So, do I get to laugh in the villain’s face, or does this trigger a reshuffle of the villain trash into the villain deck so he can start infecting people again?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:06.869Z",
